# Kubeseal (deprecated)

Seal / unseal is now part of **Kubetools**.

Use:
- `.kubetools - Seal (selection or file)`
- `.kubetools - Unseal Selected Text`

Configure `stages` in **Preferences → Package Settings → Kubetools**.

If this package is still installed, its palette commands forward to Kubetools
and show a deprecation status message. You can remove the Kubeseal package
after migrating User settings (`stages`) into `Kubetools.sublime-settings`.

Requirements: Kubetools package + `kubeseal` on PATH.
